      "content": "but the elective drinks usually only have like 100-200mg of potassium in them, which feels like nothing for a workout this intense. i feel like i'm totally depleted. wouldn't a concentrated dose like the 2000mg just be more efficient to get my levels back up quickly so i can recover? won't i just pee out the excess anyway?",
